<title>UK: SNOOKER-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS AND LATEST POSITIONS.</title>
<headline>SNOOKER-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS AND LATEST POSITIONS.</headline>
<dateline>SHEFFIELD, England 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>World snooker</p>
<p>championship results and latest positions on Sunday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round (best-of-25 frames)</p>
<p>7-Ken Doherty (Ireland) beat 10-Steve Davis (England) 13-3</p>
<p>14-Alain Robidoux (Canada) beat Stefan Mazrocis (England) 13-9</p>
<p>4-John Parrott (England) leads Anthony Hamilton (England) 8-6</p>
<p>2-John Higgins (Scotland) leads Dominic Dale (Wales) 6-2</p>
<p>12-James Wattana (Thailand) and Stephen Lee (England) level</p>
<p>4-4.</p>
</text>
